---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
---
<figure class="sbp10sellrules">
  <div class="sbp10sellrules-scroll">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 900 284" role="img" aria-label="Three written sell rules: the thesis broke, the written price was hit, or a position grew above the 10% cap.">
      <text x="20" y="30" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>Three written reasons to sell, and nothing else</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Ba lý do bán viết sẵn, ngoài ra không bán</tspan></text>
      <rect x="20" y="50" width="272" height="190" rx="8" class="card" />
      <DiagramIcon name="doc" x={50} y={82} size={28} />
      <text x="76" y="87" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>1 Thesis broke</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1 Luận điểm hỏng</tspan></text>
      <text x="38" y="118"><tspan data-lang-en>Trigger: the reason I</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Điều kiện: lý do mua</tspan></text>
      <text x="38" y="135"><tspan data-lang-en>bought is gone. Profit</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>không còn. Lãi giảm,</tspan></text>
      <text x="38" y="152"><tspan data-lang-en>falls, cash flow lags</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>dòng tiền thua lãi,</tspan></text>
      <text x="38" y="169"><tspan data-lang-en>profit, auditor objects.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>kiểm toán phản đối.</tspan></text>
      <line x1="38" y1="190" x2="274" y2="190" class="ln" />
      <text x="38" y="208" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Sell at any price.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bán ở mọi mức giá.</tspan></text>
      <rect x="314" y="50" width="272" height="190" rx="8" class="card" />
      <DiagramIcon name="stop" x={344} y={82} size={28} />
      <text x="370" y="87" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>2 Price rule</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>2 Quy tắc giá</tspan></text>
      <text x="332" y="118"><tspan data-lang-en>Trigger: a close at or</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Điều kiện: đóng cửa</tspan></text>
      <text x="332" y="135"><tspan data-lang-en>below the price I wrote</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>bằng hoặc dưới mức giá</tspan></text>
      <text x="332" y="152"><tspan data-lang-en>down before buying.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>đã viết trước khi mua.</tspan></text>
      <line x1="332" y1="190" x2="568" y2="190" class="ln" />
      <text x="332" y="208" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Sell next session. On a</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bán phiên kế tiếp. Ngày</tspan></text>
      <text x="332" y="225" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>floor day it may not fill.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>nằm sàn có thể không khớp.</tspan></text>
      <rect x="608" y="50" width="272" height="190" rx="8" class="card" />
      <DiagramIcon name="scale" x={638} y={82} size={28} />
      <text x="664" y="87" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>3 Size rule</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>3 Quy tắc tỷ trọng</tspan></text>
      <text x="626" y="118"><tspan data-lang-en>Trigger: one stock rose</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Điều kiện: một mã tăng</tspan></text>
      <text x="626" y="135"><tspan data-lang-en>until it is above 10%</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>đến khi vượt 10%</tspan></text>
      <text x="626" y="152"><tspan data-lang-en>of the portfolio.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>danh mục.</tspan></text>
      <line x1="626" y1="190" x2="862" y2="190" class="ln" />
      <text x="626" y="208" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Trim back to 10%.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bán bớt về 10%.</tspan></text>
      <text x="20" y="268" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>Each sale costs 0.15% commission + 0.1% tax = 0.25% of its value (25,000 VND on 10,000,000).</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Mỗi lệnh bán tốn phí 0,15% + thuế 0,1% = 0,25% giá trị (25.000 đồng trên 10.000.000).</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Anything outside these three, such as a headline or a red day, is not on the list.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Mọi thứ ngoài ba lý do này, như một tiêu đề báo hay một ngày đỏ, không nằm trong danh sách.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
   .sbp10sellrules { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .sbp10sellrules-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
   .sbp10sellrules svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
   .sbp10sellrules text { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
   .sbp10sellrules .t { font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
   .sbp10sellrules .h { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
   .sbp10sellrules .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
   .sbp10sellrules .m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12px; }
   .sbp10sellrules .red { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
   .sbp10sellrules .green { fill: var(--act-2); font-weight: 700; }
   .sbp10sellrules .gold { fill: var(--act-1); font-weight: 700; }
   .sbp10sellrules .card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
   .sbp10sellrules .card-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
   .sbp10sellrules .card-green { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--act-2); stroke-width: 1.6; }
   .sbp10sellrules .card-gold { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.6; }
   .sbp10sellrules .ln { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
   .sbp10sellrules .axis { stroke: var(--text-faint); stroke-width: 1.2; }
   .sbp10sellrules .dash { stroke: var(--text-faint); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
   .sbp10sellrules .arw { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.8; fill: none; }
   .sbp10sellrules .arw-h { fill: var(--text-muted); }
   .sbp10sellrules .bar-red { fill: var(--red); }
   .sbp10sellrules .bar-green { fill: var(--act-2); }
   .sbp10sellrules .bar-gold { fill: var(--gold); }
   .sbp10sellrules .bar-mut { fill: var(--text-faint); }
   .sbp10sellrules .path-line { fill: none; stroke: var(--text); stroke-width: 2; stroke-linejoin: round; }
   .sbp10sellrules .path-red { fill: none; stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; stroke-linejoin: round; }
   .sbp10sellrules .dot { fill: var(--act-2); stroke: var(--bg); stroke-width: 1.5; }
   .sbp10sellrules .dot-red { fill: var(--red); stroke: var(--bg); stroke-width: 1.5; }
   .sbp10sellrules figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
